==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bakoo]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**1 [[Bakoo]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is perhaps one of, if not the easiest [[Zero Legends]] stages with an [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Boss]] to date. Bakoo is only at 100% strength magnification here and with her high knockback count, it can be easy to juggle her with the likes of [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. Besides Bakoo, the only other enemies in this stage are peons and 2 Mr. Moles. The Mr. Moles may be an issue with their Long Distance attacks and Knockback abilities, which will interupt your cats' attacks and could allow Bakoo to attack. It is advised to defeat the first Mr. Mole before attacking the base, as the fight can become much harder with both at once.

Additionally, [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] is fully capable of juggling every enemy here, and actually benefits from Mr. Mole's knockback.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cats in the Cradle]]: Making use of his high burst, bulk and Freeze Immunity, he is a great choice for this stage. In just one hit, including the Wave Attack, he can deal 224,000 damage.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Kasa Jizo]]: Jizo is here for obvious reasons. He has Massive Damage VS Dark and juggles Bakoo to death very easily.
*[[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]]: You can use him like Bahamut or even with him. Just be sure to time him well, as he does not have Freeze Immunity
*[[Maeda Keiji (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Talented Immortal Keiji]]: While he can function well on this stage without his Freeze Immunity Ultra Talent unlocked, he's a lot better with it. Having resistance against Dark, high damage, and fast attacks helps him to juggle Bakioo.

